<title>RUSSIA: Russia to offer 11.5 trln rbls in T-bills.</title>
<headline>Russia to offer 11.5 trln rbls in T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will offer four trillion roubles ($707.6 million) in 168-day GKO discount Treasury bills (series 22073) and 7.50 trillion roubles in 294-day T-bills on February 19, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the auctions follow.</p>
